      <path d="M12 9.5h5.2a3 3 0 0 1 0 6H12m0 0h5.8a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 0 6.4H12V9.5M14.5 7v2.5M14.5 21.9v2.6M18 7v2.5M18 21.9v2.6" />
